menu "PlantHub radio role"

choice PLANTHUB_DEFAULT_RADIO_ROLE
    prompt "Default radio role (when NVS radio_role is unset)"
    default PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_WIFI_ONLY
    help
        One universal image, radio chosen at runtime: this selects what
        STARTS on a hub whose NVS has no radio_role yet. wifi_only is the
        shipped default: a fresh hub brings up WiFi and the web UI, and the
        onboarding step asks the user to pick WiFi only or BLE (a reboot
        applies BLE). ble exists for bench builds. (zigbee was a choice
        while Zigbee bridge nodes existed; retired 2026-10 -- Zigbee now
        comes from the two-chip hub's wired H2.)

config PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_WIFI_ONLY
    bool "wifi_only (neither BLE nor Zigbee)"
config PLANTHUB_RADIO_ROLE_BLE
    bool "ble"
endchoice

endmenu
